---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — FreeFontFinderAI | Zero Image Retention"
  description="Read FreeFontFinderAI's comprehensive privacy policy. We operate on a strict zero-retention guarantee: images are processed 100% client-side in-memory and never stored."
  canonicalUrl="https://freefontfinderai.com/privacy"
>
  <article class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto transition-colors">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] mb-4 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#16a34a] dark:bg-[#27a644]"></span>
        <span>100% IN-MEMORY CLIENT-SIDE PROCESSING</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.022em]">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: September 2026. Zero cloud storage, zero tracking cookies, and transparent client-side font detection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98]">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            1. Zero Image Retention Architecture
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          At FreeFontFinderAI, privacy is an architectural principle, not an afterthought. When you drag, drop, paste, or upload an image into our font finder:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li><strong>Local In-Memory Canvas:</strong> Your image is rendered strictly into an HTML5 Canvas element running within your local browser tab memory.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Cloud Upload:</strong> Image pixels, cropped glyphs, and raster bitmaps are never sent over the network to our servers or third parties for processing.</li>
          <li><strong>No Storage or Logging:</strong> We do not operate remote databases, S3 buckets, or image repositories. There is no log of your uploaded files or screenshots.</li>
          <li><strong>Instant Eviction:</strong> When you refresh the tab, close the browser, or select a new image, all memory allocated for your previous image is wiped immediately.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            2. Cookies and Local Storage
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          We believe in a clean, non-invasive web experience:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li><strong>No Tracking Cookies:</strong> We do not use third-party behavioral tracking cookies, ad-retargeting pixels, or invasive device-fingerprinting scripts.</li>
          <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> We use your browser's <code class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#d0d6e0] bg-[#f1f3f6] dark:bg-[#161718] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a]">localStorage</code> solely to save your preferred theme mode (dark or light) across sessions.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            3. Third-Party CDNs and External Services
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          To render verified typography previews and serve fast, secure static assets, we utilize trusted global infrastructure:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li><strong>Google Fonts API:</strong> To render live font specimens, your browser requests web font files directly from Google's high-speed font CDN (<code class="font-mono text-[12px]">fonts.googleapis.com</code>). Google's use of information is governed by the Google Privacy Policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare / Global CDN:</strong> Our static website assets (HTML, CSS, client JavaScript) are served via CDN providers to ensure DDoS protection, SSL encryption, and low-latency delivery.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            4. User Rights (GDPR, CCPA & Global Compliance)
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          Because FreeFontFinderAI does not collect, record, or sell personal identifiers or uploaded media:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li>We do not have personal customer data to access, rectify, or export under GDPR Articles 15-20.</li>
          <li>We do not "sell" or "share" consumer personal information as defined by the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA).</li>
          <li>You can clear all site state instantly at any time by clearing your browser cache and local storage.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            5. Contact Information
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          If you have questions, feedback, or privacy-related inquiries regarding FreeFontFinderAI, please reach out via our dedicated <a href="/contact" class="text-[#ff4d00] dark:text-[#e4f222] hover:underline font-medium">Contact Us page</a> or email us directly at <a href="mailto:support@freefontfinderai.com" class="text-[#ff4d00] dark:text-[#e4f222] hover:underline font-medium">support@freefontfinderai.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
